    // cannot write) leaves the row with a perfectly good decoded source, so it
    // is soft: retry it on this run instead of retiring it for the session.
    // Every decode-stage failure nulls it.src, so HEIC and genuinely unreadable
    // files stay filtered out below and are not resurrected here.
